{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"申命记","commonName":"申命记","title":"申命记","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"8bcef4291eceeae7f82fc249330b10c87bbadfbb92c93565cfd900e5b52a2379","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":949},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西去世"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西从摩押平原登上尼波山，上到耶利哥对面的毗斯迦山顶。耶和华把整片土地指给他看，从基列一直到但，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["拿弗他利全境，以法莲和玛拿西地区，远至地中海的犹大全境，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["南地和棕榈城耶利哥的谷地，远至琐珥。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华对摩西说：“这便是我向亚伯拉罕、以撒和雅各起誓要赐给他们子孙的土地。现在我让你亲眼看到了，但你不能进入。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，耶和华的仆人摩西死在摩押，正如耶和华所言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和华把他安葬在摩押境内伯·毗珥对面的山谷，至今无人知道摩西的坟墓在哪里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西去世时一百二十岁，眼睛没有昏花，精力没有衰败。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["以色列人在摩押平原为摩西致哀三十天，服丧的日子才结束。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["嫩的儿子约书亚充满了智慧之灵，因为摩西曾把手按在他身上。以色列人都听从他，遵守耶和华对摩西的吩咐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["此后，以色列再也没有出现像摩西那样的先知，他曾面见耶和华，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["奉耶和华的命令在埃及行神迹奇事，惩罚法老及其臣仆和国民，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["在以色列人面前行伟大而可畏的事。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}